[center][size=6][color=#93c47d][b]HIT2 DE Scyther v1.1.1[/b][/color][/size][/center]

[b]Fixed[/b]
[list]
[*]Restore materials that appeared gray or lost their textures after the October 20 game update (build 26073152).
[/list]

[b]Upgrading[/b]
[list]
[*]Close the game. Replace CSS_HIT2_DE_Scyther_XTGMods_P under MortalShell2/Content/Paks/~mods/ with the complete folder from this download.
[*]Keep CSS installed. This is the complete outfit update and does not need a separate shader patch.
[*]Remove an older standalone CSS shader-fix overlay for this outfit if you installed one. Keep your CSS settings and profiles.
[/list]
